@startuml State_AlbumSession
' If any modifications are done to the classes participating in this pattern,
' this diagram must be updated accordingly.

title State Pattern — Album Upload Session

skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam class {
  BackgroundColor #FEFECE
  BorderColor #A80036
}

note as N1
  <b>STATE (Behavioral)</b>
  AlbumSession (Context) delegates all user
  interactions to the current IAlbumState.
  IdleState handles single-file uploads and
  transitions to AlbumUploadState on /album-upload.
  AlbumUploadState accumulates files and finalizes
  the batch on /album-done, then returns to IdleState.
end note

class AlbumSession << Context >> {
  + TelegramId : long
  + PendingFiles : List<AudioFileContext>
  ~ Pipeline : AudioPipelineFacade
  ~ Ledger : LedgerService
  - _state : IAlbumState
  + CurrentStateName : string
  + TransitionTo(state) : void
  + HandleFileAsync(file, ct) : Task<string>
  + HandleAlbumUploadAsync(ct) : Task<string>
  + HandleAlbumDoneAsync(ct) : Task<string>
}

interface IAlbumState << State >> {
  + StateName : string
  + HandleFileAsync(ctx, file, ct) : Task<string>
  + HandleAlbumUploadCommandAsync(ctx, ct) : Task<string>
  + HandleAlbumDoneCommandAsync(ctx, ct) : Task<string>
}

class IdleState << ConcreteState >> {
  + StateName = "Idle"
  + HandleFileAsync(ctx, file, ct) : Task<string>
  + HandleAlbumUploadCommandAsync(ctx, ct) : Task<string>
  + HandleAlbumDoneCommandAsync(ctx, ct) : Task<string>
}

class AlbumUploadState << ConcreteState >> {
  + StateName = "AlbumUpload"
  + HandleFileAsync(ctx, file, ct) : Task<string>
  + HandleAlbumUploadCommandAsync(ctx, ct) : Task<string>
  + HandleAlbumDoneCommandAsync(ctx, ct) : Task<string>
}

note right of IdleState
  /album-upload → TransitionTo(AlbumUploadState)
  file upload  → single validation
end note

note right of AlbumUploadState
  file upload  → PendingFiles.Add()
  /album-done  → validate all + Builder report
               → TransitionTo(IdleState)
end note

IAlbumState    <|.. IdleState
IAlbumState    <|.. AlbumUploadState
AlbumSession   --> IAlbumState : _state
IdleState      ..> AlbumUploadState : <<transitions to>>
AlbumUploadState ..> IdleState  : <<transitions to>>

@enduml
